  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Son Preference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme seeks to contribute towards the impact goal of reducing gender discrimination that results in gender-biased sex selection, imbalanced sex ratios and the undervaluing of girls and women in Bangladesh, Nepal and Vietnam. Targets SDG5 and target 5.3. A cross-border study involving Nepal, Bangladesh and India will be conducted to understand potential diffusion of harmful practices across borders.</narrative>
  </description>
